  id: pho_kimchi_bulgogi
  recipeName: "Ph\u1EDF Kim Chi Bulgogi"
  region: Fusion
  basePrice: 130
  dishDescription: "Ph\u1EDF b\xF2 t\xE1i k\u1EBFt h\u1EE3p kim chi mu\u1ED1i chua cay, t\u1EA1o n\xEAn h\u01B0\u01A1ng v\u1ECB n\u01B0\u1EDBc d\xF9ng \u0111\u1EB7c bi\u1EC7t \u1EA5m n\u1ED3ng."
  culturalStory: "S\u1EF1 k\u1EBFt h\u1EE3p \u0111\u1ED9t ph\xE1 gi\u1EEFa n\u01B0\u1EDBc h\u1EA7m x\u01B0\u01A1ng ph\u1EDF H\xE0 N\u1ED9i v\xE0 kim chi truy\u1EC1n th\u1ED1ng H\xE0n Qu\u1ED1c, t\u1EA1o n\xEAn m\xF3n canh ph\u1EDF cay n\u1ED3ng \u0111\u1EADm \u0111\xE0 gi\u1EA3i c\u1EA3m."
  flavorProfile: "Chua cay thanh nh\u1EB9, b\xE9o ng\u1EADy t\u1EE7y b\xF2, th\u01A1m l\u1EEBng th\u1EA3o m\u1ED9c Vi\u1EC7t - H\xE0n"
  chefTip: "Cho kim chi v\xE0o t\xF4 tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi chan n\u01B0\u1EDBc d\xF9ng s\xF4i \u0111\u1EC3 n\u01B0\u1EDBc ph\u1EDF h\xF2a quy\u1EC7n men chua thanh c\u1EE7a kim chi"
